        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Britney Spears\n- Products: Curious, Fantasy\n- Companies: Elizabeth Arden, Jive Records\n- Places: McComb, Mississippi; Kentwood, Louisiana\n- Roles: singer, dancer, actress\n\nFacts:\n- Britney Jean Spears was born on December 2, 1981, and she is an American singer, dancer, and actress.\n- Britney Spears was born in McComb, Mississippi, and was raised in Kentwood, Louisiana.\n- Britney Spears performed acting roles in stage productions and television shows as a child before signing with Jive Records in 1997.\n- Curious is a women's fragrance by Britney Spears for Elizabeth Arden.\n- Curious was the first perfume endorsed by Britney Spears, preceding Fantasy.",
